cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite this release."
type: software
title: "Zodiac–Music–Colour Interactive Wheel"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gherbi"
    given-names: "Salah-Eddin"
version: "0.3.4 A07"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
repository-code: "https://github.com/salahealer9/zodiac-music-colour-viewer"
url: "https://salahealer9.github.io/zodiac-music-colour-viewer/"
abstract: >-
  A standalone interactive computational-geometry and music visualisation of
  12 zodiacal signs, 36 decans and 360 angular degrees, with musical notes,
  elemental triad chords, planetary-face annotations, and two design-based
  colour representations. It offers an author-defined unequal-interval
  432 Hz convention and conventional 440 Hz equal temperament. The model does
  not establish physical resonances or intrinsic planetary or zodiacal
  frequencies.
keywords:
  - research software
  - zodiacal coordinate geometry
  - computational geometry
  - interactive visualisation
  - music theory
  - Web Audio
  - colour theory
